{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L0VsZXZhdGUlMjAlMjgyMDE4JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Elevate","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/awJt2cRSDYe8cafZdlSs78Z5prX.jpg","description":"Trina's job gets the best of her as she tries to complete just one day of healthy eating. Harassed by her cruel boss and overwhelmed by the trapped elevator occupants that reach out to her for help, her only escape is Lola, a fitness guru who she desperately tries to emulate. In this slow building drama of intertwining stories about people trapped in elevators, our heroes and villains must fight to overcome their struggles with homophobia, food addiction and racism.","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"9.0","runtime":"95 min","cast":["Brianna Brown","Alexis Carra","Kit Williamson","Sascha Rosemann","Jeremiah OC Jahi","Ben Jurand","Angela Matemotja","Amir Abdullah"],"director":["Angela Matemotja"],"released":"2018-10-20T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Brianna Brown","character":"Bretta Louie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eDvUSmOXm6Bz5QIjZkzKJTRvP5x.jpg"},{"name":"Alexis Carra","character":"Lola","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qMwvtZVV24JYKcSDiqVjHvjHq8x.jpg"},{"name":"Kit Williamson","character":"Daryl","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dpsgs7ud2GVnirNSSSIXyeA0hJ.jpg"},{"name":"Sascha Rosemann","character":"Gunther"},{"name":"Jeremiah OC Jahi","character":"Trapped Man"},{"name":"Ben Jurand","character":"Leon","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1KqEgEUASUDec6yz92v6LcqMAk6.jpg"},{"name":"Angela Matemotja","character":"Trina","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/99PVYkBElGJa9cmTogDdvXm9tp8.jpg"},{"name":"Amir Abdullah","character":"Bernard","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A6usuI4G9LCa8EUlV0FDgyWW5gZ.jpg"}]}}}